OFFICIAL USE ONLY
As a basis for selecting the actions to be studied, an overalllist was first prepared of a large number of varied armor actionsin World War II.* The list was drawn up by the senior study par-ticipants in a planning conference for the study. It includedfive Northwest Europe actions during 1944-1945.
torea was excluded because of the small numbers of tanksinvolved in individual actions.
